    "/apis/v1/soundcloud/profiles/{handle}/tracks": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Lists a SoundCloud profile's tracks, newest first. Results are paged: while `data.page.hasMore` is true, send `data.page.nextCursor` as `cursor` to get the next page.\n\n> **Request example pending verification.** The request example for this endpoint has not yet been verified in production. Static examples describe the request format; replace sample values with your own. Check the estimated price with a free quote request (`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`) before running it.",
